WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.069 --> 00:00:06.306
THANK YOU
FOR COMING IN

00:00:06.406 --> 00:00:08.007
WITH YOUR ASSOCIATES.

00:00:08.107 --> 00:00:11.710
I KNOW THIS IS HARD TO HEAR,
BUT...

00:00:11.810 --> 00:00:13.179
WE NEED TO MAKE
SOME SERIOUS DECISIONS

00:00:13.279 --> 00:00:15.415
ABOUT YOUR MOTHER'S HEALTH.
LET'S BE HONEST.

00:00:15.515 --> 00:00:17.317
SHE IS GETTING ON
IN YEARS.

00:00:17.417 --> 00:00:19.786
- OH, SNAP.

00:00:19.886 --> 00:00:22.122
OKAY, I SEE HOW IT IS.
I SEE HOW IT I--

00:00:22.222 --> 00:00:26.659
WELL, YO MAMA SO OLD,
HER LAST NAME IS "OSAURUS."

00:00:26.760 --> 00:00:27.960
[laughter]

00:00:28.060 --> 00:00:31.063
- BOOM!

00:00:31.163 --> 00:00:34.100
- N-NO, MR. LOUIS,
IT WASN'T AN INSULT.

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:36.469
I--I WAS JUST SAYING
THAT YOUR MOTHER'S CONDITION

00:00:36.569 --> 00:00:39.205
IS DETERIORATING, UH,
BECAUSE SHE'S GETTING OLDER.

00:00:39.305 --> 00:00:42.976
- OH, SEE THAT'S COLD, THOUGH.
THAT'S A COLD ONE, OKAY.

00:00:43.076 --> 00:00:45.411
OKAY, I SEE HOW IT IS.
HEY, Y'ALL.

00:00:45.511 --> 00:00:48.982
YO MAMA SO OLD,
IN HER HISTORY CLASS,

00:00:49.082 --> 00:00:50.549
THEY JUST WROTE DOWN
WHAT THEY WAS DOING.

00:00:50.650 --> 00:00:52.318
[laughter]

00:00:52.418 --> 00:00:54.654
HE'S TALKING ABOUT--
HE'S TALKING ABOUT--

00:00:54.754 --> 00:00:56.556
CH-CH-CH-CH-CH--
CH-CH-CH-CH-CH-CH-CH-CH-CH-CH--

00:00:56.656 --> 00:00:57.990
[laughs]

00:00:58.090 --> 00:00:59.992
- MR. LOUIS,
THIS ISN'T AN INSULT CONTEST.

00:01:00.092 --> 00:01:01.593
NOT ONLY
IS YOUR MOTHER ELDERLY,

00:01:01.694 --> 00:01:03.863
BUT ALSO HER ABILITY
TO WALK

00:01:03.963 --> 00:01:06.166
IS CURRENTLY BEING AFFECTED
BY HER WEIGHT.

00:01:06.266 --> 00:01:07.533
- OH.
- OOH.

00:01:07.634 --> 00:01:09.669
- SEE, OKAY.
IT JUST GOT REAL.

00:01:09.769 --> 00:01:13.072
- NO, I'M NOT INSULTING HER.
I'M TRYING TO TELL YOU THE--

00:01:13.172 --> 00:01:16.442
- YO MAMA IS SO FAT, WHEN
SHE GO TO THE MOVIE THEATER,

00:01:16.542 --> 00:01:18.311
BITCH SITTING
NEXT TO EVERYONE.

00:01:18.411 --> 00:01:22.047
- EXCUSE ME. EXCUSE ME.
- LISTEN TO ME, OKAY?

00:01:22.147 --> 00:01:24.650
YOUR MOTHER NEEDS
TO MANAGE HER WEIGHT,

00:01:24.750 --> 00:01:26.285
OR THERE CAN BE
SOME REAL PROBLEMS.

00:01:26.385 --> 00:01:28.688
- OH...KAY!
ALL RIGHT.

00:01:28.788 --> 00:01:30.823
OH, YEAH.

00:01:30.923 --> 00:01:34.426
YO MAMA IS SO FAT, SHE NEED
A LATITUDE AND LONGITUDE NUMBER

00:01:34.527 --> 00:01:36.629
TO FIND
HER OWN ASS[bleep].

00:01:36.729 --> 00:01:38.231
- OH!
[laughter]

00:01:38.331 --> 00:01:41.768
- LOOK AT HIS FACE! YEAH!
LOOK AT HIS FACE!

00:01:41.868 --> 00:01:43.402
- AH! AH!
- GIVE IT TO HIM.

00:01:43.502 --> 00:01:44.704
- OH.
- GIVE ME SOME.

00:01:44.804 --> 00:01:46.873
- IT'S COORDINATES, SON.
COORDINATES.

00:01:46.973 --> 00:01:48.607
NOW WHO'S THE DOCTOR?

00:01:48.707 --> 00:01:50.943
- I AM THE DOCTOR.
MR. LOUIS, I AM.

00:01:51.044 --> 00:01:53.379
AND IT IS MY JOB TO MAKE SURE
THAT YOUR MOTHER

00:01:53.479 --> 00:01:55.080
IS GETTING THE CARE
THAT SHE NEEDS.

00:01:55.181 --> 00:01:56.315
WE ARE TALKING ABOUT THE WOMAN
WHO TOOK CARE

00:01:56.415 --> 00:01:57.650
OF YOU YOUR WHOLE LIFE.

00:01:57.750 --> 00:01:59.151
THE LEAST YOU CAN DO
IS TAKE CARE OF HER

00:01:59.251 --> 00:02:01.855
IN HER OLD AGE
AND TAKE THIS SERIOUSLY!

00:02:07.760 --> 00:02:08.962
- I'M SORRY.

00:02:09.062 --> 00:02:11.464
- I'M SORRY
THAT I LOST MY TEMPER.

00:02:11.564 --> 00:02:14.366
- NO, REALLY, DOCTOR.

00:02:14.466 --> 00:02:16.969
I GUESS...
I WAS JUST JOKING AROUND

00:02:17.069 --> 00:02:20.673
BECAUSE I KNOW HER CONDITION
IS REALLY SERIOUS.

00:02:20.773 --> 00:02:24.543
AND...I DON'T KNOW,
I GUESS HUMOR

00:02:24.643 --> 00:02:28.080
IS THE ONLY WAY
I CAN REALLY DEAL WITH IT, UH--

00:02:28.180 --> 00:02:29.849
[sighs]

00:02:29.949 --> 00:02:32.017
I JUST KNOW
THAT SHE'S SAID SO MANY TIMES

00:02:32.117 --> 00:02:34.720
SHE DOESN'T WANT
ANYTHING INVASIVE DONE.

00:02:34.820 --> 00:02:37.923
- REALLY?
I WAS NOT AWARE OF THAT.

00:02:38.023 --> 00:02:39.859
UM, THAT'S INTERESTING,
BECAUSE SHE DID NOT MENTION THAT

00:02:39.959 --> 00:02:41.527
TO ME IN OUR
PREVIOUS CONVERSATION...

00:02:41.627 --> 00:02:44.497
'COURSE IT WAS DIFFICULT
TO HEAR HER

00:02:44.597 --> 00:02:49.202
WITH MY [bleep]
IN HER MOUTH.

00:02:57.142 --> 00:02:59.945
SNAP, MR. LOUIS.

00:03:00.045 --> 00:03:02.015
OH, SNAP.

00:03:02.115 --> 00:03:03.983
NOW LET'S TALK
ABOUT THE PROCEDURE.

